   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Oceans MDTF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of the OMC-MDTF is to support analytical work, policy advisory and piloting of approaches to assist the Government of Indonesia in developing and implementing its National Oceans Agenda. The OMC-MDTF would provide technical assistance, analytical support, pilot activities and financing to assist the Government of Indonesia in developing and implementing its National Oceans Agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
